      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the radio is not available, then we don\u0027t get card state info, so it might either not have ever been reported or may be stale (which also means UNKNOWN). This is part of tightening up the meaning of NOT_READY to imply \"card known to be present, but apps not running\".",
